    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ouclaw</strong> is a cosy minion-managing action adventure about herding cats. Play as <i>Giblet</i>, a five eyed magic cat from space who commands mischievous shadow kittens called <i>Shades</i>. Fight monsters, solve puzzles, collect treasure, and explore a galaxy of vibrant worlds. Morph your underlings into various forms, creating shields, bridges, bombs and more to aid in your journey - Who knows what they\u2019ll become next?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/fba4081f4bd723ae234c58c82aa6d001.poster.avif?t=1754663012\" width=616 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/fba4081f4bd723ae234c58c82aa6d001.webm?t=1754663012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN ARMY OF CHAOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather an ever-expanding horde of loyal shades. Command them to battle enemies, collect items, and activate strange machines. They\u2019re powerful - but they need your direction. Lead the charge, revive fallen comrades, and use teamwork to turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/ca1e07074cdd0e62de18767aa31a7265.poster.avif?t=1754663012\" width=616 height=231 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/ca1e07074cdd0e62de18767aa31a7265.webm?t=1754663012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>SHAPE YOUR SHADES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your Shades into various useful constructs - stairs, boats, weapons and more. Make bigger, stronger forms by using multiple shades at once. Learn six freeform shapes you can place and upgrade wherever you want, and discover many others hidden around the world in secret locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/c35cbebfccb5c377a0bf0fd9b83d3d9e.poster.avif?t=1754663012\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/c35cbebfccb5c377a0bf0fd9b83d3d9e.webm?t=1754663012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRYSTALS, CONSTELLATIONS AND CATS </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through crystalline coral reefs, autumnal forest villages, ancient ruins, and more in a starlit universe full of whimsy and wonder. Discover a rich story of gods, monsters, and a powerful pantheon pulling the strings from the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/6b7cfdcf8cca09111c279ccbd1523e18.poster.avif?t=1754663012\" width=616 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/6b7cfdcf8cca09111c279ccbd1523e18.webm?t=1754663012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>BUILD A FAMILY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned in space, Giblet finds belonging among misfits and outcasts. Befriend a quirky cast\u2014 a cryptic detective, a pair of overworked siblings, an artistic rock monster and many more are waiting for you to find them. Turn your hideout into a bustling home for the ultimate cat army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/b18f3f07277a99cc6c1463646ab742a2.poster.avif?t=1754663012\" width=616 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/b18f3f07277a99cc6c1463646ab742a2.webm?t=1754663012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GIVE THE LITTLE GUYS HATS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deck out your Shades with a wide variety of hats and body types. Create a regiment of top\u2011hat aristocats, leaf\u2011masked forest sprites, crystal\u2011mohawk marauders - make them your own, and bring your favorites along on every adventure.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ouclaw</strong> is a cosy minion-managing action adventure about herding cats. Play as <i>Giblet</i>, a five eyed magic cat from space who commands mischievous shadow kittens called <i>Shades</i>. Fight monsters, solve puzzles, collect treasure, and explore a galaxy of vibrant worlds. Morph your underlings into various forms, creating shields, bridges, bombs and more to aid in your journey - Who knows what they\u2019ll become next?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/fba4081f4bd723ae234c58c82aa6d001.poster.avif?t=1754663012\" width=616 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/fba4081f4bd723ae234c58c82aa6d001.webm?t=1754663012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN ARMY OF CHAOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather an ever-expanding horde of loyal shades. Command them to battle enemies, collect items, and activate strange machines. They\u2019re powerful - but they need your direction. Lead the charge, revive fallen comrades, and use teamwork to turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/ca1e07074cdd0e62de18767aa31a7265.poster.avif?t=1754663012\" width=616 height=231 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/ca1e07074cdd0e62de18767aa31a7265.webm?t=1754663012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>SHAPE YOUR SHADES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your Shades into various useful constructs - stairs, boats, weapons and more. Make bigger, stronger forms by using multiple shades at once. Learn six freeform shapes you can place and upgrade wherever you want, and discover many others hidden around the world in secret locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/c35cbebfccb5c377a0bf0fd9b83d3d9e.poster.avif?t=1754663012\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/c35cbebfccb5c377a0bf0fd9b83d3d9e.webm?t=1754663012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRYSTALS, CONSTELLATIONS AND CATS </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through crystalline coral reefs, autumnal forest villages, ancient ruins, and more in a starlit universe full of whimsy and wonder. Discover a rich story of gods, monsters, and a powerful pantheon pulling the strings from the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/6b7cfdcf8cca09111c279ccbd1523e18.poster.avif?t=1754663012\" width=616 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/6b7cfdcf8cca09111c279ccbd1523e18.webm?t=1754663012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>BUILD A FAMILY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned in space, Giblet finds belonging among misfits and outcasts. Befriend a quirky cast\u2014 a cryptic detective, a pair of overworked siblings, an artistic rock monster and many more are waiting for you to find them. Turn your hideout into a bustling home for the ultimate cat army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/b18f3f07277a99cc6c1463646ab742a2.poster.avif?t=1754663012\" width=616 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165050/extras/b18f3f07277a99cc6c1463646ab742a2.webm?t=1754663012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GIVE THE LITTLE GUYS HATS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deck out your Shades with a wide variety of hats and body types. Create a regiment of top\u2011hat aristocats, leaf\u2011masked forest sprites, crystal\u2011mohawk marauders - make them your own, and bring your favorites along on every adventure.</p>",
